# Online Question Bank System (OQB2)

Flask web app for managing, browsing, tagging, and generating exam question papers from a library of image/doc assets.

## Tech Stack
- **Backend**: Python 3, Flask 3, SQLAlchemy ORM, MariaDB (pymysql)
- **Frontend**: Bootstrap 5 + HTMX (no SPA framework — server-rendered with HTMX partials)
- **Document output**: python-docx + Pillow
- **Auth**: Flask-Login

## Entry Points
- `run.py` — start dev server
- `init_db.py` — create DB tables
- `cli.py` — CLI (ingest, sync)
- `.env` — all environment config (DB credentials, SOURCE_PATH, OUTPUT_PATH)

## Blueprint Map

| Blueprint | File | URL Prefix | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `auth_bp` | `app/auth.py` | `/` | Login / logout / register |
| `dashboard_bp` | `app/dashboard.py` | `/dashboard` | Question browsing, filtering, search |
| `admin_bp` | `app/admin.py` | `/admin` | Admin panel (topics, questions, users, ingest, export) |
| `generator_bp` | `app/generator.py` | `/generate` | Word doc generation + viewer mode |
| `user_bp` | `app/user.py` | `/user` | My Files + Saved Filter Profiles |

## Key Files to Read for Context
- `app/models.py` — **source of truth** for DB schema and all model relationships
- `app/utils.py` — permission decorators, sort helpers (`apply_multi_sort`, `SORT_FIELDS`)
- `app/config.py` — all config keys and their `.env` defaults
- `CHANGELOG.md` — most current record of features (more accurate than DEVELOPER_SPEC.md)

## Permission System (3 tiers)
- `is_super_admin` — god mode, full access to everything
- `role='admin'` in `UserSubjectPermission` — subject admin (can tag, edit, ingest for that subject)
- `role='user'` — can browse and generate documents for that subject
- `role='viewer'` — read-only, cannot generate

Decorators in `app/utils.py`: `@admin_required`, `@super_admin_required`, `@subject_admin_required`

## Question ID (QID) Format
- Past papers: `SUBJ_SOURCE_YEAR_PAPER_QNO` → e.g. `MATC_DSE_2024_P1_Q5`
- Question bank: `SUBJ_QB_DETAIL_QNO` → e.g. `MATC_QB_MATHSMART2024_Q1`

## Asset Files
Stored at `SOURCE_PATH` (from `.env`). Assets are images (IMG) or Word docs (DOC), with types QUE/ANS/SOL and languages EN/CH/BI.

## Templates
All in `templates/`. Partials (HTMX targets) are in `templates/partials/`.
`base.html` is the shared layout.

